 handle","start":124.76000213623047},{"end":130.67999267578125,"text":"You know you got yourself in that level","start":127.91999816894531},{"end":134.32000732421875,"text":"You know you're to blame, you know you're ashamed","start":130.9600067138672},{"end":138.60000610351562,"text":"You know you can't even be truthful to your own","start":134.32000732421875},{"end":139.5800018310547,"text":"No","start":138.86000061035156},{"end":143.3800048828125,"text":"That's why you threw me under the bus","start":140.22000122070312},{"end":146.0800018310547,"text":"Under the bus, under the bus","start":143.3800048828125},{"end":148.89999389648438,"text":"Fuck what you say, fuck what you say","start":146.3000030517578},{"end":152.16000366210938,"text":"I got some good things happening now","start":148.89999389648438},{"end":156.13999938964844,"text":"Yeah, she just like you, but better, better, better","start":152.16000366210938},{"end":157.86000061035156,"text":"Found another you, you","start":156.13999938964844},{"end":161.66000366210938,"text":"Yeah, I found another you, hey","start":158.4600067138672},{"end":163.67999267578125,"text":"She doesn't want that","start":161.66000366210938},{"end":165.17999267578125,"text":"She got one of her own tracks","start":163.67999267578125},{"end":166.4199981689453,"text":"She got her own top man","start":165.17999267578125},{"end":167.8800048828125,"text":"And she keep it like that","start":166.4199981689453},{"end":171.6199951171875,"text":"She got a wisdom like you'll get to the next one","start":167.8800048828125},{"end":174.89999389648438,"text":"She got more than you can guess on","start":171.67999267578125},{"end":176.3000030517578,"text":"More than you can even be","start":174.89999389648438},{"end":178.02000427246094,"text":"Or more than you can even breathe","start":176.3000030517578},{"end":180.74000549316406,"text":"But you're still beautiful, you see","start":178.02000427246094},{"end":183.1999969482422,"text":"Sorry you get 